  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap buffer overflow in the XML dictionary QName\n     interning path\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-86138.patch: Add integer overflow checks to the\n       pool size calculation in xmlDictAddQString() in dict.c, and cap the\n       prefix and name lengths in xmlDictQLookup() so the sum namelen + plen + 1\n       cannot wrap and undersize the pool allocation\n     - CVE-2026-86138",
